00:58:07.560 --> 00:58:10.390
<v Ira Glass>This American Life is distributed by Public Radio International.

00:58:10.390 --> 00:58:32.390
<v Ira Glass>[FUNDING CREDITS]

00:58:32.390 --> 00:58:41.170
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight by Torey Malatia. We all asked him if we could have this weekend off, work five days this week instead of seven. His reply.

00:58:41.170 --> 00:58:45.170
<v Dave Ramsey>You're not willing to work? I don't know anything to call that but lazy.

00:58:45.170 --> 00:58:49.300
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.

00:58:49.300 --> 00:58:56.230
